{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922045234_3f51611c","chunk_index":22,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_c41ac953b62f7d4d"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922045234_3f51611c","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:93068827759c5ec48f41ec0c","quote":"章节编号=14.5\n章节标题=项目特异附录\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"b5c7e48b70f93fb69e86c9974b7435ec6acd56542e22b20278f28e95feda0304","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:93068827759c5ec48f41ec0c","span_id":"span_section_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究题目：合成试验药A用于治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究\n试验药物：合成试验药A\n适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病\n研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"d2050153d129d39f9cefa4972e91ed9c6832dd16bedf8b16334634a5274dd8ea","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"7f681385325ea50f0f3485a11a274883a165e7afebec524cdf8c19713d99555d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_pasi_spga_timing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"96a84653cf6d1348916ceb15f0ff4db3aa2ea6561a7aec7f1f4c5db4803356ac","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_dlqi_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_adherence"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_section_identity","span_study_identity","span_pasi_spga_timing","span_dlqi_endpoint","span_safety_endpoints","span_adherence"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"项目特异附录","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本附录适用于合成试验药A治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究，汇总本项目专用评估工具与记录材料，供各研究中心在相应评估时点统一使用。疗效及生活质量评估工具包括PASI、sPGA和DLQI：PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价，DLQI用于评价第16周评分较基线的变化。安全性评估涵盖治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。本附录同时收录依从性评价工具，即药品计数及受试者日记，以支持对试验药与匹配安慰剂给药依从性的评价。上述工具与记录表用于支持各研究中心按照本项目的评估时点完成数据采集，并作为项目专用参考文件与方案正文共同使用。","rationale":"正文依据当前项目已确认事实：目标章节为14.5项目特异附录；项目为合成试验药A治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究；PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；DLQI用于评价第16周评分较基线的变化；安全性评估包括TEAE、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。需医学作者核对：PASI、sPGA、DLQI的版本、中文版授权状态及培训材料；药品计数表和受试者日记的具体模板与填写说明；附录是否需要收录实验室检查、心电图操作手册或参考范围；附录编号、目录结构以及与方案其他章节的交叉引用关系。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_c41ac953b62f7d4d","section_number":"14.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:93068827759c5ec48f41ec0c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2410eb4e97ccdc","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v